<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85675" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Alc.</u>
			595
		</span></i> (lyr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the sea,</i> epith. of
			Poseidon, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				22.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1072
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντιε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1010
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Θέτις, Νηρηΐδες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				3.35
			</span></i>, <i>p.</i><i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δάκη</span>
			<i>sea</i> monsters, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				582
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βόσκημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					275
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὕδωρ, πέλαγος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματα, θύελλα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1659
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾅδην π.
			πεφευγότες,</span> i.e. death by drowning, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				667
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ῥάκη,</span> of sponges or fragments
			of such, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				258
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>by the sea,</i> of places, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσθμός,
				ἀκτή, Χρύση,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				8.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				449
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				269
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>in the sea,</i> of islands, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				8.18
			</span></i>; esp. of those <i>far out to sea,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσγειοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				368b33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.6.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				8.6.6
			</span></i>; of ships, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάριδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					553
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					253
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of
			persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκέτας δέχεσθαι ποντίους</span>”
				<i>from the sea,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					300
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφιέναι πόντιον</span>”
				<i>into the sea,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					797
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>brought by sea</i> or <i>from beyond sea,</i> of iron, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				940
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
